# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GRC Audit — environment configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WITHOUT any key below, the app runs in built-in DEMO mode: a local analysis
# engine maps each incident to the frameworks and generates the remediation.
# This is enough to run `npm run dev` and test all four example scenarios.
#
# Add a key to enable full LLM-powered analysis of any free-text incident.
# If both keys are set, Anthropic is used. Override the model with LLM_MODEL.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in a key.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Anthropic (Claude) — https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI — https://platform.openai.com/
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional model override (defaults: claude-sonnet-5-5 / gpt-4o-mini)
# LLM_MODEL=
